# Design system — Tailwind only

Read `.arlox/design-system.json` — this project uses **Tailwind utility classes** with no component library.

## Rules

- Use **Tailwind utility classes** exclusively for styling.
- No second UI component library (no MUI, shadcn, Chakra, etc.).
- The only CSS file is `src/index.css` (Tailwind directives).
- Use `src/lib/cn.ts` to conditionally join class strings.

## Component style

- Prefer readable inline classes over extracted abstractions.
- Extract a helper only when the same combination repeats 3+ times across files.
